e src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/026c85757828194e12d24d0439cd30e9.mp4?t=1755090536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Sort through the items and appreciate the resulting order and the details of the story that unfolds in the process. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/c5196e3048f53a046d89bc215eb236f9.poster.avif?t=1755090536\" width=600 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/c5196e3048f53a046d89bc215eb236f9.webm?t=1755090536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/c5196e3048f53a046d89bc215eb236f9.mp4?t=1755090536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore the chaos and enjoy your freedom to drag, erase, disassemble, break, and fix things in the highly interactive space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/3a7e046c8b29b7d14becb3272d5af07e.poster.avif?t=1755090536\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/3a7e046c8b29b7d14becb3272d5af07e.webp?t=1755090536\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=52 /></picture></span></p>",
